16.overview:
Assume you have an interface Payable:
public interface Payable {
    double getPaymentAmount();
}
You have class Invoice with getQuantity() and getPricePerItem(). Which implementation is correct? Eliminate distractors that confuse related Java / OOP terms before picking B.

✅ Answer: B — public class Invoice implements Payable { public double getPaymentAmount(){ return getQuantity()*getPricePerItem(); } }

